    "terrainName": "cqb-village",
    "description": "What: On cqb-village, 'Blue Platoon' (Friend, 'Blue Squad 1-3', 4 men each, in file on Main Street's west end) runs UrbanMovement (CE-2284 U-1) along two legs: east down Main Street to the Cross Road (200,190), then south down it to (200,120); no enemy. Judge: (1) Squad 1 leads with its crossing drill (SquadMarch, DangerAreas) and takes the second leg when it reaches the first's end; (2) Squads 2 and 3 march in file about 30 m and 60 m behind it along the route (re-ordered as it moves on, not every metre); (3) all three end at the route's end, in order, and the task succeeds. Fail: a follower walks with the lead or cuts the corner, the lead never turns south, or the task never ends. Check: python3 scripts/utility-demo-check.py --launch pc-urban-move"
  },
